        <item>
            <title>3.27.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:14:34 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>232</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.27.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- **Status grouping**: a new **Status** option in the sidebar's group picker splits open sessions into Needs you, Done · unseen, Working and Idle, with a count on each section.
- **Jump to the next session that needs you**: Cmd+J (and Cmd+Shift+J backwards) cycles through sessions waiting on a permission or a question, then ones that finished while you were not looking. Works in every grouping mode.
- **What a session is waiting for**: rows that need you, or finished unseen, show one line under the title: the question, the command or file it wants to touch, or the first line of its last reply.
- **Background tasks and time in state**: each open row shows `bg: N` while background tasks run, and how long it has been in its current state (`now`, `5m`, `2h`, `1d`). The time survives a relaunch of the app.

### Changes
- The control API's session rows now carry `attentionLine`, `backgroundTasks` and `stateSince` (see docs/CONTROL_PROTOCOL.md).
]]></description>
